  <div class="row" style="margin-top:12px"><button id="notify-save">Save notifications</button><span class="dim" id="notify-msg"></span></div>
  <div id="notify-err" class="err" hidden></div>
  <p class="dim" style="margin:12px 0 0">Tokens are kept in <code>/config/bb-api</code>, readable by the
  container user only. They have to be sent, so they cannot be hashed the way API keys are.</p>
</div>

